WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Owtomate searches and reviews available roles.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.500
It opens a suitable role.

00:06.500 --> 00:10.500
The application reaches final review with the selected resume and prepared cover letter.

00:10.500 --> 00:11.500
Owtomate submits the application.

00:11.500 --> 00:15.000
The job site confirms the real application was sent.
